	(text "RD (Read strobe signal from the host)\nAt the falling edge of this signal, the data on the DDO- DD7, DD8-DD15 data bus from the device \nregister or data port become valid. At the rising edge of this signal, the host latches on to the data. \nUntil latching is completed, the host cannot access the data. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 377.19 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
